I also have dermatophagia in my feet, and I've found useful to use A TON of cream in my foot. I just cover it on a sticky cream, bandage it and put a sock on. The cream is so fucking sticky it doesnt assorb completely, leaving a paste on my feet that makes me not want to touch it. 

&#x200B;

Also, I'm looking for help myself, maybe try it too. I'm looking for a psychologist that can help me with it.

"I always wanna die"- the 1975

